'''Infernal Mages''' are [[Slayer monsters]] that require 45 [[Slayer]] to kill. They are mainly hunted for their unique drops: the [[fire ruby]], and the rare [[Mystic boots (dark)|dark mystic boots]] and [[Mystic hat (dark)|hat]]. Players who plan on fighting them should be wary of their accurate magic attack, although [[Protect from Magic]] negates this completely.

To reach the Infernal Mage area in the {{FloorNumber|uk=1|caps=n|nohelp=n}} of the [[Slayer Tower]], players can take the long way up the south-east stairs, which requires running past aggressive [[Banshee]]s, so wearing [[Earmuffs]] or a Slayer helmet is recommended if the player's combat level is below 47. Players with 18 [[Agility]] can avoid the banshees by using the [[Broken window (Slayer Tower)|broken window]] shortcut for quick access to the stairs.

